{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/50f6e44d6259635b2e490888ffa7faf0.avif?t=1766169377\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras_big/50f6e44d6259635b2e490888ffa7faf0.avif?t=1766169377 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SLAUGHTER VOID</strong></i>\u00a0is a stylish, vicious, and uncompromising experience with an emphasis on speed. In this high-speed &quot;dungeon runner&quot;, carve your way through enemy after enemy on a path to vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die fast. Kill faster.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/4a4b159bff701033af00d2e630a82239.poster.avif?t=1766169377\" width=662 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/4a4b159bff701033af00d2e630a82239.webm?t=1766169377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/4a4b159bff701033af00d2e630a82239.mp4?t=1766169377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced, brutal action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in<strong><i> SLAUGHTER VOID</i></strong> is quick and merciless. A single hit will kill you, but the same goes for (most of) your enemies- agility and aggression are e<i>ssential.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be your own harbinger of destruction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a deluge of hand-crafted levels, carve your own bloody path with unique combinations of weapons and relics to achieve maximum slaughter.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/638b97420636a62387a695c05eb0c6ca.poster.avif?t=1766169377\" width=800 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/638b97420636a62387a695c05eb0c6ca.webm?t=1766169377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/638b97420636a62387a695c05eb0c6ca.mp4?t=1766169377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Dismemberment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick death is not enough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you kill, the more havoc you wreak upon your foes, severing and splattering them into multiple pieces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you slaughter, the more you reap, harvesting valuable loot from their corpses to spend on upgrades, items, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/6262d11fddab5e2fdb7b298e8767d6cd.poster.avif?t=1766169377\" width=662 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/6262d11fddab5e2fdb7b298e8767d6cd.webm?t=1766169377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333980/extras/6262d11fddab5e2fdb7b298e8767d6cd.mp4?t=1766169377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To the Victor the Spoils</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete 